  "gatesNotImported": {
    "C016": "Its closed LocalCommand (submit, advance, finish) and its consent-spawning conduct belong to C015's three fixed epochs. C017 reimplements the pattern in contract.js and engine.cjs: epoch-conditional commands, idempotency by key plus the canonical C015 command digest, typed allowed recovery.",
    "C019": "Its closed code table is C015's. C017 reimplements the typed-failure shape with its own closed table in contract.js and the same recovery vocabulary (reinspect, confirm-operator-review, stop) plus correct-closed-command and retry-identical.",
    "C035": "Its classifier needs C029 and C034 trace types. C017 reimplements the honesty rule as a pure function of the journal (reconcile.cjs classify): unknown or interrupted is never reported as cancelled.",
    "C036": "Its attribution reads the live ledger and git state, which is not hermetic. C017 reimplements lease, run, user, epoch and action attribution: every command names them and every answer carries the server's own."
  },
